sequenceDiagram
    actor U as Marketing Team User
    participant FE as StartAnalysis<br/>«view»
    participant AC as AnalysisController<br/>«controller»
    participant AS as AnalysisService<br/>«service»
    participant JR as AnalysisJobRunner<br/>«async worker»
    participant PC as PostCollector<br/>«service»
    participant LC as LlmClient<br/>«client»
    participant LLM as LLM Service<br/>«external»

    U->>FE: select brand, keywords, date range
    FE->>AC: POST /api/brands/{brandId}/reports
    AC->>AS: startAnalysis(brandId, request)
    AS->>AS: validate brand and keywords (companyId scope)
    AS-->>AC: Report (status=QUEUED)
    AC-->>FE: 200 OK ReportResponse
    FE-->>U: navigate to /reports/{id}
    Note over FE: ReportStatus page now polls GET /api/reports/{id}/status every 2s<br/>(see view-result.mmd) — UI advances QUEUED → PROCESSING → COMPLETED/FAILED

    Note over JR: @Async, fires after Tx commit
    JR->>JR: markProcessing(reportId) (status=PROCESSING)
    JR->>PC: collect(brand, keywords, dateRange)
    PC-->>JR: posts from Reddit (PRAW)
    loop per batch
        JR->>LC: analyzeBatch(posts, brand, keywords)
        LC->>LLM: POST /analyze/batch
        LLM-->>LC: BatchAnalyzeResponse(results, failed)
        LC-->>JR: results + failed
    end
    alt all batches succeed
        JR->>JR: persistReviews + finalizeCompleted (status=COMPLETED)
    else exception during job
        JR->>JR: mark FAILED with failureReason
    end
